+    - Beneath it is the main field with one solid teal square, a dominant background color, and solid edge-touching obstacle blocks.
+
+    Rule:
+    - Remove the legend from the output.
+    - Fire the square-shaped beams in the order up, then right, then down, then left.
+    - A beam slides one cell at a time, painting teal only onto background cells.
+    - When a beam meets a colored obstacle, it turns according to that color's legend bar.
+    - When a later beam would step onto teal painted by an earlier beam, it stops there; finished trails persist as blockers for the remaining directions.
